        "official_en_sha256": "f0e76192019a73708260d203080b40483f56594e109e6fe337f8729d38ab2d2d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "これまでの１００年周期のように\r\n魔力の放出を終えれば\r\nゲートは勝手に閉じるじゃろうが……。",
        "official_en": "Once the gate releases all of its pent up magic, it shall close on its own—as it has done for all previous hundred-year cycles. However...",
        "real_en": "Once the magic has finished pouring out, the gate should close on its own, just like it has every hundred years... But..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C08_801_01",
        "sequence": null,
