      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "さあ、クリスタルタワーの頂上まで行くぞ。\r\n少しでもゲートに近づきたいからな。",
        "official_en": "Let’s make our way to the top of the Crystal Tower now...to get as close as possible to the gate.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
      },
