      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "よし。これでここまでは飛空艇で\r\nこられるようになるじゃろう。",
        "official_en": "’Tis done. Now we should be able to reach this point with the airship.",
        "real_en": "Good. Now the airship should be able to bring us this far."
