        "official_en_sha256": "8b5119e30d7e546416b92bfded542c69514127ec1f8d5b163cc5b4521771ffe5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "クリスタルタワーを中心に\r\n大きなエネルギーが発生しているようじゃな。\r\n無理をすると飛空艇が墜落するぞ。",
        "official_en": "A prodigious amount of energy is emanating from the Crystal Tower. Should we push too hard, this airship shall crash.",
        "real_en": "It looks like a tremendous amount of energy is being generated around the Crystal Tower. If we force our way through, the airship could crash."
      },
      "review": {
