        "official_en_sha256": "ead3b3f66f9365faa00a912ade205836d42328fce0eb616fdcc63c683bf8a2b4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "俺が魔力を一気に吸収して、強制的に放出を終わらせる。\r\nそうすれば大地が引き寄せられる前にゲートは閉じる。",
        "official_en": "I’ll absorb all the magic in one large draw to speed up the gate’s energy release procedure. That should see that the gate closes before it pulls everything in.",
        "real_en": "I'll absorb the magic all at once, forcing the release to end. Then the gate will close before the land gets pulled in."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
